---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Character from '../components/Character.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Your Name" description="A short introduction and how I work.">
  <section class="about wrap">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>Short bio in your voice, one paragraph.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Two or three sentences on what you do, who you do it for, and what makes you different.
          The reader should finish this paragraph knowing whether to keep reading — don't hedge.
        </p>

        <hr class="rule" />

        <h3>How I got here</h3>
        <p>A paragraph on the arc — where you started, what you did between then and now, and the
        thing that changed how you think about design.</p>

        <h3>What I'm looking for</h3>
        <p>Be specific. What kinds of problems, at what stage of company, in what industries?
        Portfolios that hedge get contacted by nobody.</p>

        <h3>Outside work</h3>
        <p>One or two sentences of personality. What you read, make, or care about. Skip if it feels
        forced.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="about-side">
        <Character size={220} mood="wave" />
        <ul class="fact-list">
          <li><strong>Based in</strong><span>City, Country</span></li>
          <li><strong>Available</strong><span>Freelance / Contract</span></li>
          <li><strong>Speaks</strong><span>English, ...</span></li>
          <li><strong>Currently</strong><span>Reading / building / listening to ...</span></li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about { padding-block: 4rem 6rem; }
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }
  h1 { margin-top: 1rem; }
  .lede { margin-top: 1.5rem; font-size: var(--step-1); color: var(--ink-2); }
  h3 { margin-top: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: var(--step-2); }
  p { color: var(--ink-2); margin-block: 0.75rem; }

  .about-side {
    background: var(--paper-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    position: sticky;
    top: 2rem;
  }
  .fact-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .fact-list li {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding-block: 0.75rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--rule);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
  }
  .fact-list strong { color: var(--ink); }
  .fact-list span { color: var(--ink-3); text-align: right; }

  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .about-side { position: static; }
  }
</style>
